:: R4-PunishmentBet [release4]
<<set $chatMood to "anticipatory">>
<<scene "img/scenes/punishment-announcement.png" "Femboy cosplay stream. Minimum three hours.">>

DuskBlade does the dare reveals on his own stream. Sunday afternoon. Five thousand viewers. He's in full ringmaster mode, cape and all. The man literally wears a cape on stream. It works.

//"Bracket three. EthX and LunaFrag."//

He pauses. Grins. The chat fills with anticipation emojis. He's milking this because that's what showmen do.

//"Your punishment. One full stream in femboy cosplay."//

The words don't register immediately. They sit in the air like a delayed action charge.

//"Thigh highs. Skirt. Wig. The whole nine yards. Makeup if you can manage it. On camera. Minimum three hours."//

Chat erupts. Not just DuskBlade's chat, the tournament community Discord, Twitter, everywhere at once.

<div class="pt-chat">
<<chathead 5000>>
<div class="pt-chat-body">
<<chatline "viewer1" "FEMBOY STREAM LMAOOO" "#63b3ed">>
<<chatline "viewer2" "ethx in a skirt I'm SCREAMING" "#e0556f">>
<<chatline "viewer3" "this is going to be legendary" "#e0b84d">>
<<chatline "viewer4" "lowkey ethx has the face for it tho 👀" "#c084dc">>
</div>
</div>

That last one. I read it three times. Lowkey ethx has the face for it tho. Some stranger on the internet looked at me and saw something I haven't let myself see. Something about my jaw, maybe. My cheekbones. The softness I've always been slightly insecure about.

LunaFrag messages me immediately.

<div class="pt-phone">
<<phonehead "LunaFrag" "Direct message" "L">>
<<msg "" "well. at least I'm already a girl lmao. I'll just go extra femme. you're the one who has to do the heavy lifting" "left">>
<<msg "" "i might just eat the $500" "right">>
<<msg "" "dude you cannot afford to lose that $500 and you know it. just do the stream. three hours. it'll blow over" "left">>
</div>

She's right. Of course she's right. Five hundred dollars I put on a credit card I can't pay off. The deposit is non-refundable. The dare is non-negotiable. The waiver I signed, scrolling past the terms like everyone does, has a clause about forfeiting the deposit if you refuse the punishment.

Five hundred dollars for a skirt and a wig. Three hours. Then it's over.

I text Riley. "femboy stream"

<div class="pt-phone">
<<phonehead "Riley" "Discord DM" "R">>
<<msg "" "OH MY GOD" "left">>
<<msg "" "WAIT" "left">>
<<msg "" "actually" "left">>
<<msg "" "this could be incredible content" "left">>
</div>

Trust Riley to see the angle before the embarrassment.

